cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GlucoEdge or its bundled models, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GlucoEdge: on-device glucose trend classification (research prototype)"
authors:
  - family-names: Menasy
    given-names: Mohamed
repository-code: "https://github.com/mohamedmenasy/GlucoEdge"
license: MIT
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
abstract: >-
  Android and iOS research prototype that maps 12 five-minute continuous
  glucose monitor readings to one of five trend classes with a small 1D CNN,
  converted to LiteRT float and INT8, with the full computational record of
  its manuscript. Not a medical device. Code is MIT; the bundled model
  weights are CC BY-NC 4.0 (LICENSE-MODELS).
keywords:
  - continuous glucose monitoring
  - on-device machine learning
  - post-training quantization
  - LiteRT
